"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/kipi.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"¿Sabíes que los complementos Kipi tamién pueden usase nos programes Digikam, "
"Kimdaba, Showimg y Gwenview?\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

